<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Optical &amp; Sensors</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Optical and sensor manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures camera modules, MEMS and optical sensors, and LCOS/HTPS microdisplays using cleanroom assembly, active optical alignment and low-stress packaging processes. These products are built under controlled handling and ESD conditions, with optical and sensor manufacturing capability across multiple Hana sites.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Optical &amp; Sensors &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Camera modules</span><span>Microdisplays</span><span>Proximity sensors</span><span>Ambient light sensors</span><span>MEMS sensors</span><span>Infrared modules</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Why optical and sensor buyers choose Hana</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Precision assembly under controlled conditions</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Optical and sensor assemblies require precise alignment, controlled handling and protection of sensitive die throughout production. Hana supports these requirements with active optical alignment, cleanroom assembly, low-stress die attach and functional test under controlled ESD conditions. Camera modules, microdisplays and sensor products are manufactured using established optical and microassembly processes across the group.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Precision assembly</div><p>Active optical alignment and low-stress assembly for camera modules, sensors and microdisplays with micron-level alignment requirements.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Controlled cleanroom manufacturing</div><p>Cleanroom assembly and ESD-controlled handling for sensitive optical and sensor devices.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>Optical and sensor manufacturing across Hana sites in the USA and Thailand provides additional capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c3"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/optical-sensors/camera-modules"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Camera module on an active-alignment station &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Camera Modules</div><p>Complete camera-module assembly, including image sensor integration, active optical alignment, lens housings and infrared module capability, with functional test at finished-unit level.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/optical-sensors/mems-sensors"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ MEMS sensor die under cleanroom assembly &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">MEMS Sensors</div><p>MEMS, proximity, ambient-light, color and time-of-flight sensor assembly and packaging under cleanroom and ESD-controlled conditions.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/optical-sensors/microdisplay"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ LCOS microdisplay panel &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Microdisplay (LCOS/HTPS)</div><p>LCOS and HTPS microdisplay processing and packaging for projection, simulation and optical-system applications, supported by Hana's LCD and microassembly capability.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2><p class="mk-body">Optical and sensor programs are manufactured across Hana sites in the USA and Thailand, with camera modules and microdisplays concentrated in Ohio and sensor assembly in Ayutthaya. Programs can be qualified across additional Hana capability where required for manufacturing continuity. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><div class="note">camera modules, microdisplays</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><div class="note">proximity &amp; ambient light sensors, MEMS, fiber-optic</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">supporting PCBA and board-level assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from optical and sensor engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for optical and sensor products?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures camera modules, including infrared modules, MEMS and optical sensors such as proximity, ambient light, color and time-of-flight devices, and LCOS/HTPS microdisplays. Depending on the program, these can be assembled and tested as complete optical or sensor units.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Why does optical and sensor assembly need cleanroom and alignment?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Optical and sensor products can require micron-level alignment and controlled protection from contamination and static discharge. Hana uses cleanroom manufacturing, controlled ESD handling and active optical alignment for camera modules where required by the product.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve optical and sensor programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Camera modules and microdisplays are manufactured in Ohio, USA, while proximity, ambient light and MEMS sensor assembly runs in Ayutthaya, Thailand. Supporting board-level assembly is also available in Lamphun.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana handle miniature, sensitive sensor assemblies?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana supports miniature optical and MEMS sensor assemblies using low-stress die attach, controlled handling and cleanroom manufacturing processes.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start an optical or sensor build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what the device has to see or sense, and where it runs. We will point you to the right site and processes, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>